        "body": "Since 1976, The Big Four has stood as a culinary landmark in Nob Hill, sharing good company and iconic classics amidst a historic and romantic ambiance. Located within The Huntington Hotel, The Big Four returns in its 50th year with New American cuisine, a classic bar, live piano music nightly and rich in San Francisco history. Leading the kitchen, Award-Winning Executive Chef David Intonato brings elegant technique and approachable style to the menu, featuring hearty, celebratory dishes inspired by supper club tradition with a nod to modern sensibility. For breakfast, lunch and dinner, guests can expect American classics with a California lens, showcasing fresh, regional produce, coastal seafood and premium cuts. "
